# Web (`civil-web`)

React + TypeScript. Follow `project-core` frontend architecture.

```
src/
  features/<feature>/components|hooks|<FeaturePage>.tsx
  components/
  hooks/
  services/
  stores/
```

- REST `/api/v1` only — never DB/Redis/Prisma
- Zod for UX; backend is the security boundary
- Zustand for client/UI state only
- Shared UI in `components/`; feature UI stays in the feature
- Page loading: shadcn `Skeleton` + presets in `components/feedback/skeletons` via `AsyncState` `loadingFallback` — see `web-skeletons` rule
